    {
      "text": "great is your reward in heaven, Matt. 5:12 (Luke 6:23, 35; 3 Ne. 12:12; D&C 127:4). love them which love you, what reward have ye, Matt. 5:46. alms before men … ye have no reward, Matt. 6:1. thy Father which seeth in secret shall reward thee openly, Matt. 6:6. receiveth a prophet … shall receive a prophet’s reward, Matt. 10:41. shall in no wise lose his reward, Matt. 10:42 (Mark 9:41). reward every man according to his works, Matt. 16:27 (2 Tim. 4:14; Rev. 22:12; D&C 101:65; 138:59). receive an hundredfold now in this time, Mark 10:30. receive the due reward of our deeds, Luke 23:41 (D&C 64:11). man shall receive his own reward according to his own labour, 1 Cor. 3:8. if I do this thing willingly, I have a reward, 1 Cor. 9:17. shall receive the reward of the inheritance, Col. 3:24. labourer is worthy of his reward, 1 Tim. 5:18. rewarder of them that diligently seek him, Heb. 11:6. respect unto the recompence of the reward, Heb. 11:26. shall receive the reward of unrighteousness, 2 Pet. 2:13. that we receive a full reward, 2 Jn. 1:8. greedily after the error of Balaam for reward, Jude 1:11. be thou faithful … and I will give thee a crown, Rev. 2:10. Reward her even as she rewarded you, Rev. 18:6.",
